{"id":"vod_lz_6283","vodId":"6283","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"黑执事3","name_cn":"黑执事3","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220411-1/b7be5642dd3d012b573634ee439bc281.jpg"},"summary":"19世纪的英国，一位人称“恶之贵族”的名门少爷，为了达成自己的心愿，与恶魔结下契约，必有一位执事在其侧近。是一名集知识、教养、品位、料理、武术等技能于 一身，堪称完美全能的执事。由于少爷因商场上的诸多胁迫遭受众多贵族怨恨，执事除了照顾少爷的日常起居外，同时身兼少爷的保镖，献上与名门贵族相称的最优质招待。今天的执事也是身着漆黑的燕尾服，执行他华丽的执务。  热闹的马戏团，总为人们带来快乐与欢笑。但他们所经之处，却有许多孩子无故失踪。夏尔与黑执事塞巴斯蒂安，为了调查真相而潜入马戏团。究竟在马戏团的背后，隐藏着什么秘密？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-04-11 14:22:51","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"classicRank":118,"franchise":"黑执事","playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6535_4419173f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6536_f0a83d2f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6538_d354aebb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6537_94fe506f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6539_f739a492/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6540_9e0c4c41/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6541_f1ec76ff/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6544_5181e6da/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6542_db25bb71/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6543_a9c461b4/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6545_6fe8dfbd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220411/6548_247b31ef/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T05:52:10.101Z"}